<title>USA: U.S. business loans rose $8.3 bln in April 16 week.</title>
<headline>U.S. business loans rose $8.3 bln in April 16 week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial and industrial loans on the books of U.S. commercial banks rose $8.3 billion to $812.3 billion in the week ended April 16, the Federal Reserve said on Friday.</p>
